---
// EngineCards — generated by generate_translated_components.py
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-[#080810]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="font-mono text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] mb-4">// ВСТРОЕННЫЕ ДВИЖКИ</div>
      <h2 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">4 программных движка. 640+ проверенных команд.</h2>
      <p class="text-[#9CA3AF] text-base max-w-2xl mb-6">Каждая возможность AgentPuter работает через настоящий программный движок — управление через CLI, а не скриншоты GUI.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-6 text-xs text-[#4B5563] font-mono">
        <span><span class="text-accent">640+</span> проверенных командных последовательностей</span>
        <span><span class="text-accent">4</span> движка для ключевых сценариев</span>
        <span><span class="text-accent">100%</span> локальная обработка</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(56,189,248,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">📄</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #38BDF8;">ap-docs</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #38BDF8; background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08);">158 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">LibreOffice</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #38BDF8; opacity: 0.7;">Writer · Calc · Impress · Draw — Безголовый режим</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Полное управление пакетом LibreOffice в безголовом режиме. Создавайте Word/Excel/PPT/PDF с макросами, шаблонами и диаграммами.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Документы Writer</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Таблицы Calc</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Презентации Impress</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Графика Draw</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Экспорт PDF</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.08); color: #38BDF8;">Применение шаблонов</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs new --type report</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs chart --data file.csv</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs export --pdf --toc</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-docs macro run --name monthly</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Квартальные отчёты</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Технические доки</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Составление договоров</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #38BDF8;">Смотреть кейсы →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(167,139,250,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎨</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #A78BFA;">ap-design</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #A78BFA; background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08);">203 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">Inkscape</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #A78BFA; opacity: 0.7;">SVG-вектор · Постер · Иконка · Логотип · Пиксельный экспорт</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Точное CLI-управление SVG-узлами, путями, фильтрами и вёрсткой текста через Inkscape. Экспорт в любом разрешении.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">SVG-векторное искусство</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Дизайн постеров</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Генерация иконок</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Операции с путями</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Эффекты фильтров</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: #A78BFA;">Пакетный экспорт</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design canvas --size 1080x1920</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design text --weight bold --color white</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design export --png 2x</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-design batch --variants 10</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Маркетинговые постеры</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Брендовые ресурсы</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">UI-иконки</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #A78BFA;">Смотреть кейсы →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(251,191,36,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">📐</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #FBBF24;">ap-diagrams</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #FBBF24; background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08);">138 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">Draw.io (diagrams.net)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #FBBF24; opacity: 0.7;">Блок-схемы · Архитектура · ER · Последовательности · UML</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">Программное создание профессиональных технических диаграмм через draw.io CLI. Встроенные библиотеки иконок AWS/GCP/Azure.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Архитектура микросервисов</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Топология сети</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">ER-диаграммы БД</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Бизнес-процессы</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">Диаграммы последовательностей</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); color: #FBBF24;">UML-диаграммы классов</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams new --type microservice</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams add node --label 'API Gateway'</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams export --svg --theme dark</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-diagrams from-schema --input db.sql</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Системная архитектура</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Проектирование БД</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Бизнес-процессы</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #FBBF24;">Смотреть кейсы →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#0D0D1A] rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 border transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" style="border-color: rgba(74,222,128,0.2);">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-3xl">🎵</span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="font-bold font-mono text-base" style="color: #4ADE80;">ap-audio</span>
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="color: #4ADE80; background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08);">141 ✓</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[#4A4A6A] text-xs mt-0.5">sox + ffmpeg</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono mb-3" style="color: #4ADE80; opacity: 0.7;">Шумоподавление · Редактирование · Конвертация · Нормализация громкости</p>
          <p class="text-[#6B7280] text-xs leading-relaxed mb-5">sox обрабатывает аудиоэффекты и анализ; ffmpeg управляет конвертацией кодеков и контейнеров.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
            <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Умное шумоподавление</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Обнаружение и обрезка тишины</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Нормализация EBU R128</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Конвертация форматов</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Многодорожечное сведение</span>
              <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-mono" style="background: rgba(74,222,128,0.08); color: #4ADE80;">Анализ аудио</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/40 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-1.5 mb-5 font-mono">
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio denoise --input raw.wav</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio loudnorm --target -14 LUFS</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio convert --mp3 128k</span></p>
            <p class="text-xs"><span class="text-[#2A2A3A]">$ </span><span class="text-[#94A3B8]">ap-audio trim --remove-silence</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Постпродакшн подкастов</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Запись курсов</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-[#4B5563] border border-[#1E1E2E] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">Аудио встреч</span>
            </div>
            <a href="/features" class="text-xs font-mono transition-colors" style="color: #4ADE80;">Смотреть кейсы →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#1E1E2E]">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold tracking-widest mb-3">// ПОЧЕМУ CLI, А НЕ GUI?</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 text-xs text-[#4B5563] leading-relaxed">
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">Стабильное API</p>CLI-интерфейсы не ломаются при обновлениях UI. Одна интеграция работает долгосрочно.</div>
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">Точное управление</p>Прямое управление файлами, координатами и параметрами — идеальный вывод до пикселя.</div>
        <div><p class="text-[#94A3B8] font-semibold mb-1">Пакетная обработка</p>Одна команда выполняет 100+ задач одновременно. GUI-автоматизация может кликать только одно за раз.</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[#2A2A3A] text-xs font-mono mt-4">// Based on CLI-Anything by HKUDS Lab (MIT License) · Extended &amp; internalized by AgentPuter</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
